    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Me, You and Kaiju, battle against your friends in an action-packed, asymmetric, local-multiplayer party game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you step into VR as the mighty Kaiju to wreak havoc &amp; squash your puny friends? Or will you pick up a controller, jump in a chopper and take to the skies with your buddies to take down the Kaiju and save Earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4 players can grab a gamepad and play split screen against the VR-controlled Kaiju</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of various different vehicles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the level, flanking the Kaiju, while dodging the onslaught of attacks it\u2019s throwing at you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your buddies by manning the gunner seat of their vehicles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/7349284e29e46e21e1a47bf3a9e0638f.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/7349284e29e46e21e1a47bf3a9e0638f.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/7349284e29e46e21e1a47bf3a9e0638f.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/786d8086c89f2d6e88737a3472f5c51a.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/786d8086c89f2d6e88737a3472f5c51a.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/786d8086c89f2d6e88737a3472f5c51a.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the kaiju and experience being a giant in VR</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your surroundings as ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and block projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special attack to unleash havoc across the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different kaiju\u2019s each with their own unique powers<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/9a357b0087e2b75aaf3ed4d036390916.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/9a357b0087e2b75aaf3ed4d036390916.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/9a357b0087e2b75aaf3ed4d036390916.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/a7663f92b50a7b6647cfa29f328343d4.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/a7663f92b50a7b6647cfa29f328343d4.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/a7663f92b50a7b6647cfa29f328343d4.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle across a variety of different maps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/ac5b99355bd692d9c1a2bf94c0beb2d8.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/ac5b99355bd692d9c1a2bf94c0beb2d8.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/ac5b99355bd692d9c1a2bf94c0beb2d8.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Choose the way you want to play! Me, You &amp; Kaiju has a few different game modes there\u2019s sure to be one to accommodate your group of friends!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Me, You and Kaiju, battle against your friends in an action-packed, asymmetric, local-multiplayer party game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you step into VR as the mighty Kaiju to wreak havoc &amp; squash your puny friends? Or will you pick up a controller, jump in a chopper and take to the skies with your buddies to take down the Kaiju and save Earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4 players can grab a gamepad and play split screen against the VR-controlled Kaiju</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of various different vehicles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the level, flanking the Kaiju, while dodging the onslaught of attacks it\u2019s throwing at you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your buddies by manning the gunner seat of their vehicles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/7349284e29e46e21e1a47bf3a9e0638f.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/7349284e29e46e21e1a47bf3a9e0638f.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/7349284e29e46e21e1a47bf3a9e0638f.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/786d8086c89f2d6e88737a3472f5c51a.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/786d8086c89f2d6e88737a3472f5c51a