agraph\" ><strong>Battle across a variety of different maps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/ac5b99355bd692d9c1a2bf94c0beb2d8.poster.avif?t=1728016255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/ac5b99355bd692d9c1a2bf94c0beb2d8.webm?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092200/extras/ac5b99355bd692d9c1a2bf94c0beb2d8.mp4?t=1728016255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Choose the way you want to play! Me, You &amp; Kaiju has a few different game modes there\u2019s sure to be one to accommodate your group of friends!</strong></p>",
